From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:00:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] cheetah: install one Android System Intelligence, the
 Pixel 7 Pro's

vendor/gms installs DevicePersonalizationAiAiPrebuiltPixel2026 (ASI built
for the Pixel 11) next to this tree's DevicePersonalizationAiAiPixel2022, both
com.google.android.as. PackageManager kept the higher version, the Pixel 11
build, until Play replaced it with its pixel7 build. Override vendor/gms's
copy so the system image carries the one built for this phone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 749f9db..f333d8a 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -320,6 +320,7 @@ android_app_import {
     owner: "google",
     apk: "proprietary/product/priv-app/DevicePersonalizationAiAiPrebuiltPixel2022/DevicePersonalizationAiAiPrebuiltPixel2022.apk",
     overrides: [
+        "DevicePersonalizationAiAiPrebuiltPixel2026",
         "DevicePersonalizationAiAiPrebuiltPixel2025",
     ],
     preprocessed: true,
